# The build context is the repository root; only these paths may enter the image build.
# Everything else (every .env, SMS backups, the data lake's local files) stays out.
*
!backend/pyproject.toml
!backend/README.md
!backend/src
!backend/alembic
!backend/alembic.ini
!data-engineering/pyproject.toml
!data-engineering/src
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
